Package: happymining-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HappyMining monitoring agent for GPU hosts
 Unprivileged systemd agent that reports host telemetry (GPU, CPU, memory,
 disk space, service state) to the HappyMining API, with a local operator
 command (happyminingctl) and a narrowly scoped privileged helper whose two
 actions are disabled by default.
 .
 The agent only observes and reports. It does not install, change or remove
 Docker, NVIDIA drivers or the Vast host software, it never talks to the Vast
 API and it never reads renter containers, files or processes.
